Declare and guard Web Worker globals that are available in Bun
but not in the Node.js main thread. The RPC module assigns
onmessage and calls postMessage which only exist as Worker
globals in Bun. Wrap in typeof guards and declare the types.

Index: packages/opencode/src/util/rpc.ts
